    "   \"id\": \"cell-04-header\",\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"## Cell 4 — Dataset\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"Loads or generates the labelled audio dataset. Three modes are tried in order:\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"1. **BYO CSV** (`CUSTOM_TRAIN_CSV` set) — uses your existing `path,label` CSV directly.  \\n\",\n",
    "    \"   If `CUSTOM_TEST_CSV` is not set, an 80/20 split is written once to `OUTPUT_DIR/dataset_split/` and reused on subsequent runs.\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"2. **HF override** (`HF_DATASET` set) — downloads positives from the specified HuggingFace repo instead of the auto-detected one.\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"3. **Auto** (default) — for known wake words (e.g. *hey jarvis*, *hey mycroft*) positives are downloaded from HF; for unknown wake words they are synthesised via TTS.  \\n\",\n",
    "    \"   Either way, `reuse_dataset=True` means re-running this cell never re-synthesises audio that already exists.\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"**Augmentation overrides** (`BG_NOISE_DIR`, `MUSIC_DIR`, `RIR_DIR`) replace the corresponding HF downloads with local audio.  \\n\",\n",
    "    \"**Extra HF repos** (`EXTRA_*_HF`) are appended to the built-in lists — both can be set simultaneously.\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"Dataset logic lives in `notebooks/nb_dataset.py` — import it to reuse these helpers outside the notebook.\"\n",
    "   ]\n",
    "  },\n",
    "  {\n",
    "   \"cell_type\": \"code\",\n",
    "   \"id\": \"cell-04\",\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {\n",
    "    \"ExecuteTime\": {\n",
    "     \"end_time\": \"2026-03-20T03:02:51.475148Z\",\n",
    "     \"start_time\": \"2026-03-20T03:02:51.438412Z\"\n",
    "    }\n",
    "   },\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"import sys\\n\",\n",
    "    \"from pathlib import Path\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"# Make nb_dataset importable when running from the notebooks/ directory\\n\",\n",
    "    \"sys.path.insert(0, str(Path(\\\"__file__\\\").parent if \\\"__file__\\\" in dir() else Path(\\\".\\\")))\\n\",\n",
    "    \"from nb_dataset import load_byo, load_generated, apply_local_overrides\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"if CUSTOM_TRAIN_CSV:\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    datagen_result = load_byo(\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        train_csv=CUSTOM_TRAIN_CSV, test_csv=CUSTOM_TEST_CSV,\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        output_dir=OUTPUT_DIR, seed=SEED,\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        negatives_dir=NEGATIVES_DIR,\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        bg_noise_dir=BG_NOISE_DIR, music_dir=MUSIC_DIR, rir_dir=RIR_DIR,\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    )\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    print(\\\"Mode: BYO CSV\\\")\\n\",\n",
    "    \"else:\\n\",\n",
    "    \"    datagen_result = load_generated(\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        wake_word=WAKE_WORD, output_dir=OUTPUT_DIR,\\n\",\n",
    "    \"        n_positive=N_POSITIVE, lang=LANG,\\n\",\n",
