    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"## Next Steps\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"### Improve accuracy\\n\",\n",
    "    \"- Increase `N_POSITIVE` (500+ for production models)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"- Set `DOWNLOAD_AUGMENT=true` to add background noise, music, and room reverb during training\\n\",\n",
    "    \"- Set `ADVERSARIAL=true` (default) — adds hard confusable negatives\\n\",\n",
    "    \"- Set `SEARCH_FULL=true` and increase `POPULATION` / `GENERATIONS` for a deeper search\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"### Bring your own data\\n\",\n",
    "    \"- `CUSTOM_TRAIN_CSV=/path/to/metadata.csv` — skip TTS entirely\\n\",\n",
    "    \"- `NEGATIVES_DIR=/path/to/neg/` — custom not-wake-word audio\\n\",\n",
    "    \"- `BG_NOISE_DIR`, `MUSIC_DIR`, `RIR_DIR` — local augmentation audio\\n\",\n",
    "    \"- `EXTRA_NEGATIVES_HF=org/repo1,org/repo2` — additional HF negative sources\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"### Change the model family\\n\",\n",
    "    \"- `TIERS_TO_TRAIN=micro,small,medium,large` — MFCC classifiers, all sizes\\n\",\n",
    "    \"- `TIERS_TO_TRAIN=hubert_small,hubert_medium` — HuBERT-based (GPU required)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"- `TIERS_TO_TRAIN=whisper_small` — Whisper encoder backbone (GPU required)\\n\",\n",
    "    \"- `TIERS_TO_TRAIN=markov` — zero training, Markov chain model, ultra-lightweight\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"### Deploy\\n\",\n",
    "    \"- ONNX models in `OUTPUT_DIR/model_<tier>/best_f1.onnx` drop into any OVOS plugin\\n\",\n",
    "    \"- See [deployment guide](../docs/training.md) for plugin packaging instructions\\n\",\n",
    "    \"\\n\",\n",
    "    \"### Resources\\n\",\n",
    "    \"- [Quickstart guide](../docs/quickstart.md) — single-command training from Python\\n\",\n",
